New project folders belong under `~/Documents/workspace/projects/<name>/`, not flat at `~/Documents/workspace/<name>/`. The `projects/` subdirectory holds accessbuddy, life-os-console, lifesaveroncall, inkwell, envelope-os, and siblings. The workspace root itself holds the older flat project folders (career, finance, gym, personal, pai, etc.) plus workspace-level files, so the layout is mixed. For anything new, default to `workspace/projects/`.

Each project is a `<project>/ISA.md` at its root as the system of record, per the convergence recipe. Source thinking docs go in `<project>/docs/`.

Nick corrected this on 2026-06-18 when I first persisted Penny (envelope-os) flat at the workspace root.
